# Good Times In Cape Town: legacy WordPress URLs -> Cloudflare Pages
# Proposed 7 Nov 2026. Replaces the deployed _redirects in full. Lines marked
# (live) reproduce the 9 redirects deployment 1fe1f8ff already serves.
#
# Rules: top-most match wins; static rules first, splats last.
# Each static rule is listed with and without the trailing slash. Query strings pass through.
# Not handled here (see audit): /api/*, /admin/*, /assets/video/* are Pages Functions
# routes, so _redirects never applies to them; www -> apex needs a zone Redirect Rule;
# ?p= / ?page_id= query URLs cannot be matched by _redirects.

